{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fda00ef5-ee35-8044-a114-128dbce5b344",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T13:04:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beatriz Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:01:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:01:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. [pause] I'm calling about a pothole. It's at the corner by my place, 312 Dean Avenue, right at the intersection."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:01:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 312 Dean Avenue. Is it right in the middle of the intersection or off to one side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:01:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on the edge where you turn in, on the right side as you come off the corner. It's been patched three times now. Three. And every time it opens up again within a couple of weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:01:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three patches and it keeps reopening. Do you remember roughly when the last one was done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:01:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, maybe early January. Somebody came out with the cold patch stuff. And then after the storm this past weekend, the Saturday into Sunday one, it's open again. Bigger, actually."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:01:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the freeze and thaw plus all that water is hard on those patches. Is it deep enough that cars are bottoming out or swerving around it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "People swerve around it, yes. [pause] I have photos on my phone, from before and after the last patch and from yesterday. I can send them if there's somewhere to send them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:02:19-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would help. I can have someone email you about where to send those, or if you have an email I can note it on the request. Do you want to give me a callback number as well?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:02:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The phone number is fine. It's 401-555-0186. I'll just wait for the email part from whoever follows up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:02:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0186. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:02:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Beatriz Figueroa. F-I-G-U-E-R-O-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:02:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Beatriz. I've got the request in for 312 Dean Avenue, the intersection pothole, repeat repair, photos available."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:02:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I ask how long repairs usually take? Just so I know what to expect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:03:01-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends. After a storm like this there's a stack of requests, so it can be a few days to a couple of weeks. Since this one's been patched repeatedly, I'll flag it so they look at a more lasting fix rather than another quick fill. I can't tell you the exact day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:03:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I just wanted a rough idea. [pause] Sorry, I'm in the middle of comparison shopping for a new mattress, so I've got about six tabs open and I'm trying to keep track of everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:03:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Sounds like a long list. Anything else about the road I should add? Any damage to a car or anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:03:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No damage. Just the hole, and it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:03:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Someone from the department will be in touch about the photos, and the crew will get the location. You're all set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:03:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:04:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:04:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
